diff --git a/docs/utils.rst b/docs/utils.rst
index 995c171..c2a6278 100644
--- a/docs/utils.rst
+++ b/docs/utils.rst
@@ -217,6 +217,17 @@ Example usage::
     import click
     click.edit(filename='/etc/passwd')
 
+The editor can also be launched with a specific working directory using the
+``working_dir`` parameter. This is useful when the editor needs to resolve
+relative paths or when you want to ensure the editor starts in a specific
+directory.
+
+Example usage::
+
+    import click
+    import os
+    click.edit('message', working_dir=os.getcwd())
+
 
 Launching Applications
 ----------------------
